# TruthInStyle Art-Directed Interface Commands

- Narrow control.panel only. No dead gutter.
- The stage starts immediately next to control.panel and fills the viewport.
- Section anchors stay. Control glyphs may be restyled.
- Organic UI needs masks: parchment panels, cloud fields, soft panels.
- Pink text/shimmer is required.
- No helper copy, no browser-default styling, no purple base unless palette calls for it.
- Inputs must visually flow around anchor assets using grid placement and z-index.
- Eye of Truth is image asset only, no label; `Tell No Lies` may sit nearby.
